{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1000_p", "source_sha256": "10db4d84937f058cfeea36dc31e2efa4d4265c8ac144e312c52a8def9869dca7", "ja": "おーい、みんな。\nちょっと集まってくれないか？", "zh": "喂──各位。\n可以过来集合一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "bb15f700a4ea1334a10d9e3b0b2fd11e4272692e10841fe5a38b1ad97a48cdf2", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}♪\nお疲れ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}♪\n辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cbec9bd9e55158b8d077b832fe86774d904cdb80ea4779631e894a60bc58f8a0", "ja": "お疲れさま、恵美。\nエレナと可憐も一緒なんだな、ちょうどよかった。", "zh": "辛苦了，惠美。\n艾琳娜和可怜也在啊，这样正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "239b4510292989e63b5464bcad3811fcae0554b136593de9818d53c822e715a0", "ja": "ウン！　{$P$}、\nワタシ達に、何か用事？", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}，\n你找我们有事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6aac75a0c5873ca151c5645b3558f973c7a1e1464c4638d7ea002bfb5ed69a0a", "ja": "ああ。次の公演は、みんなに出てもらおうと思って。\nで、センターは恵美に任せたい。", "zh": "是啊，我想请你们在下次的公演出场表演。\n然后Center的部分就由惠美负责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "b8b397da2ac97090ee888b7493665ebb0763e47bd25f15c90787626cd2f86d6a", "ja": "えっ……ああ、アタシ！？　{$P$}、\n本気っ？　エレナか可憐の間違いじゃなくて！？", "zh": "咦……我、我吗！？{$P$}，\n你是认真的？确定不是艾琳娜或可怜！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6cbbb0c49f4f47f702d435c527ecd2fbb1d59507eab2072819c42d89b8af350a", "ja": "俺が決めてるんだから、間違いじゃないよ。\nどうだ恵美、やってくれるか？", "zh": "这是我下的决定，当然确定啰。\n怎么样，惠美？你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "baec29bab75618226ed3eae45beffeef53c6805de7abbbea4109a59186069321", "ja": "ワォ！！　やったネ、メグミ♪\nお祝いしなくちゃだヨ～！", "zh": "哇！！太棒了，惠美♪\n得好好庆祝一下才行唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "42bcc07e85bd8469f2afa9c48c94fd147ea5dab4d7c5cb1a4932bbd847d88455", "ja": "は、はい……センター、すごいです……！　私なんて、\nステージに立つだけで、き、気絶しそうなのに……。", "zh": "是、是啊……能当上Center，真的很厉害……！\n哪像我光是站上舞台，就、就觉得快昏倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "d240c4e41efb3fa9739c715e104723f15317a02908c01c6d595076836ebf9cac", "ja": "同い年なのに、すごいな……そ、尊敬しちゃう……♪\n恵美ちゃん、頑張ってください……！", "zh": "我们明明年纪一样大，真不简单……好、好崇拜你……♪\n惠美，加油喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "c81f7d3cdc276d1419da6cd2c8e1464684f12c6ed2a05d7010d8d661ccaafc0c", "ja": "あ、あはははは……。そう言われちゃうと、\nなんか照れるね？　ふたりとも、ありがと！", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈哈哈……被你们这样一说，\n我都开始不好意思了。谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "afcecca13304c9bb1fff4f3062429e8046f6543389fc20adb5c8a3225c970254", "ja": "けど、アタシがセンターか～。\nアタシなんかで、大丈夫なのかな？", "zh": "不过，我是Center啊～\n让我来当，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f26e65dbc63923f9309aa5b6532cd4ec3c3443b574bf60cf0a1dfa016dee911b", "ja": "もちろん！　大丈夫だと思ったから選んだんだ。", "zh": "当然！我就是觉得没问题，才会选你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "deeadbd1aa72952ce76075ed38688d14fd7a5d075a57f8b36671125e0bce01d1", "ja": "そうだよ、メグミ！　ワタシとカレンも手伝うヨ♪\n振り付けは、まだ覚えてないケド……エヘヘ。", "zh": "就是说啊，惠美！我和可怜也会帮忙唷♪\n虽然舞步我也还没学起来……嘿嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "0ab0d2f9c11daa2d0407e5abb23091345af7b45daba364a63f05e785cf333fa5", "ja": "ふふっ……そ、そうですね……。わ、私達も……\nちゃんと、練習して……頑張らなくっちゃ……！", "zh": "呵呵……是、是啊……我、我们……\n也得认真练习……好好加油……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c4f1f2ec38afa7a57feaf63ef0e953920c060e495431d20e3263cc5de63ec1e", "ja": "あはは♪　そうだよね、みんなして振り付け\n覚えてないんじゃ、しょーがないね！", "zh": "啊哈哈♪说得也是。\n既然大家都还没记好舞步，那就没办法啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "7a817ff11bd21c2b73e2f9f6288613623222fd86a3f38027a6f50794d3389054", "ja": "それじゃ、ちゃんと覚えるまで、\n一緒に練習しよっか？", "zh": "我们就一起练习到完全记起来为止吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "dcd85b9f5db42d722fea1edcbdaeed5ada08205856696791929fd95bda6cd7a5", "ja": "ハーイ♪　練習するヨ～♪", "zh": "好～♪一起练习吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "0fc6ec852560da05cc2bce266dbf0c4b5ba828bcb91dc1fa35d5fbc361e460a7", "ja": "は、はい……！\n恵美ちゃん、エレナさん、よろしくお願いします……！", "zh": "好、好的……！\n惠美、艾琳娜，请你们多多指教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_012_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1e65aef59966923076a00a608167a7e97b0da104388bec81262714d5dd2bd1df", "ja": "みんな、よろしく頼んだぞ。", "zh": "各位，就交给你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
